{"availability":"available","full":"oddessentials/agent-guild","name":"agent-guild","description":"Orchestrate the swarm. An agentic coder building suite for managing simultaneous workflows and accounts.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-30T03:01:41Z","updated":"2026-10-03T03:31:54Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":null,"color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Agent Guild runs Claude Code, Codex CLI, Antigravity CLI, Grok Build and your own shell side by side, in real terminals, from one local web page. Each session is a card that shows what the tool is doing, which model it runs and which helper agents it has summoned. Close the page whenever you like; the sessions keep working."],"features":["Every major coding CLI, one place. Claude Code, Codex CLI, Antigravity CLI, Grok Build and a plain shell each get a card. A tool that is missing shows Install, which runs the install in a session you can watch, or the…","Real terminals that outlive the page. Every session is a full interactive terminal: type instructions, answer prompts, watch output. Run as many as you like. A local session manager owns them, so you can close or reload…","Agents and models at work. Helper agents that a tool starts appear on its card as familiars while they run, and the card names the model in use. The character comes alive while the session works, and the session's level…","Several subscriptions per tool. Add a work account next to your personal one and switch with a chip on the card. Each account keeps its own sign-in, usage meters and sessions. See Accounts.","Pick the right m